title three rooms to ninety-nine
prompt Keaton said kg image, lotus, brushstroke -- the last 145 with no meter question behind them.
think Checked the trailing-versus-bare split first, and it decided the shape: image 57 bare, lotus 47 bare, brushstroke 35 bare with 6 trailing. Almost all genuine writing.
obs image sorted into clear classes once read. Channel clamps where a value is about to be written into a u8 and would wrap to a dark pixel rather than clamp to a bright one. Pixel-count ceilings that keep a width-times-height multiplication inside a u64. And eight sort postconditions, each stating the order the sort produced rather than checking one it was handed -- a comparator that is not a total order leaves pairs out of place, and that is exactly where it shows.
obs hmaxima carried the best one: the reconstruction never rises above the mask, which is what makes h-maxima a reconstruction rather than a repaint. Two asserts, one idea, and nothing had said it.
obs lotus is an audio suite and its asserts read as a chain of postconditions once written. A gate or expander asserts the tail is fully attenuated, which is what the envelope exists to reach -- a residue means the release never completed and the next clip would open over it. A limiter asserts the output keeps the sign it came in with, since a flip would invert the waveform at the peak. A transport asserts the playhead stays inside the take.
obs smooth_runs holds four properties in one block: runs begin where the input began, cover exactly what it covered, carry at least one sample each, and never repeat a verdict. Together they say a smoothing merged runs rather than losing or inventing them.
obs brushstroke is glass geometry: a stride reaching a whole row of RGBA, so a shorter one reads the next row's pixels as this row's tail; a cell array exactly rows by columns; a grid with real dimensions so a touch divides by something.
obs 121 blocks in all. image 2,734 of 2,734, lotus 1,264 of 1,264, brushstroke 572 of 572. Tree 99%, gap 121.
obs Ran both room roster witnesses after, since I touched every module in two rostered rooms. Both GREEN, along with ast-check on 88 files, tame and width.
